  "releaseNotes": "perf(model): refactor HttpModel memory structure and remove safety checks\n\n      - Remove redundant CheckSafety() calls in PooledObject to optimize Hot-Path branching and CPU I-Cache.\n      - Implement lazy-initialized Buffers (Cache, HeadersBuffer, CookiesBuffer) to eliminate zero-header memory overhead.\n      - Replace List<HeaderEntry> with contiguous struct Buffer storage for Data-Oriented Design (DOD) cache locality.\n      - Achieve peak throughput of ~197.7k req/s at ~93us avg latency in local benchmarks.",
